sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Staff
  participant M as Live Map
  participant D as Done Today
  participant A as My Account
  participant S as Server
  F->>M: 1: Tap Live Map
  M->>S: 2: GET /api/map
  S-->>M: 3: Station, rider, numbered orders, deliveries running
  S-->>M: 4: Live rider location (WebSocket)
  F->>M: 5: Tap the rider or a pin
  M-->>F: 6: Rider card (Call) or the order
  F->>D: 7: Tap Done Today
  D->>S: 8: GET /api/work/done-today
  S-->>D: 9: Gallons processed, orders logged and sent out
  F->>A: 10: Tap My Account
  A-->>F: 11: Profile, change password, log out
